{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_01_end","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_01","title":"化物","storyCode":"IW-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"eddd8573ea5e992e7fe58b20731b33dbb253869a95ca2381d0027b0b4a031eed","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"1下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼停下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫不是剛才我出手太重，不小心傷了姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，會點花裡胡哨的功夫，得意什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經被那江洋大盜跑了，再和你糾纏也沒有什麼意義，你這種——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，哪有賊人會自報姓名的，想必是什麼江湖名號吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您真聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要是接著追，你是不是就不打算讓開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然怎麼說您聰明呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還敢嘴硬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還愣著幹什麼！一起上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐！我們來幫忙了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——慢著！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡怎麼說也是客棧，二位再這麼鬧下去，瘡痍滿目，白給路人看笑話，怕是不太妥當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，二位打得精彩，給我們這些人開了眼界，賠償呢......我就不要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在還請給我一個薄面，今天就先算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，掌櫃的。事後解開誤會，我們自會登門道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看在掌櫃的面子上，這次就放過你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你們和他是什麼關係，勸你們好自為之，乖乖把他交出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是包庇他，你們就都是同罪。放過你一時無妨，但尚蜀容不下你們這樣的法外之徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要是法外之徒，報警就是了，杜小姐何必私下動武呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有兄弟說的是，再怎麼佔理，也不該一言不合就動起手來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你的人退下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小、小姐，就這麼放走他......？抓著他一個，等著那個龍門人上鉤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別嚷嚷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正那個龍門人已經跑了，留住這一個也沒多大用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再說了，當真能留得住嗎？你是不是還有什麼手段沒使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，和氣生財，和氣生財。既然這位小姐願意退一步，那是再好不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有，我記住你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴人多忘事，但願您別記著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（悄悄地，悄悄地......好，這個距離差不多能衝出去了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是賣鄭老頭一個面子，出了這道門檻，看誰還能保得住你。不如趁現在老老實實聽本小姐的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——喂！人呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他怎麼就這麼跑沒影了！？你們在做什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......是小姐您剛才也沒說到底要不要放走他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......愣著幹什麼！追啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杜大小姐哎，您鬧得是不是太大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸，別——得了，家務事我可管不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄭老頭！你剛才為什麼無動於衷，反而還要攔著我！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......胡鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼胡鬧！你不是明知道他們會往應峰路走，才在這裡等著他們的嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡幾十家客棧酒樓都是我們的眼線，要抓一個不知輕重的小賊不是輕而易舉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知輕重的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道那隻酒盞是什麼物件，你更不知道剛才那龍門人，到底是什麼來頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況剛才有高人在場。如果他們真鐵了心把事情鬧大，贏的會是他們，佔理的也會是他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是什麼？你知道這一紙委託，到底幾斤幾兩？那位佚名主顧，又是怎樣一位人物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憑你也想丟鏢局的臉嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好像沒人追來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起各位，本來該是我領路的，卻落得如此田地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也實在是沒想到，到了尚蜀城內，竟然還能遇上這種事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留那小夥子一個人，真沒問題嗎？我們這算不算坑了他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個老闆和那位盛氣凌人的小姐怕是認識。留下殿後的那位好漢，恐怕沒那麼容易脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......鯉先生怎麼知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那姑娘分明幾次都在留意掌櫃的一舉一動，我不會看走眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看走眼，生意就沒法做了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能相信小烏有的逃跑速度了，這點我倒是對他有信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。那個女孩也不敢在光天化日之下做什麼出格舉動吧？雖然人少，可那時裡裡外外，還是有一些路人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，能在這裡遇見你們羅德島，真是巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生怎麼會來尚蜀？是事務所的委託？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧，不過只是一個老朋友委託給我的私事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是那個盒子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這真是奇了怪了，在這尚蜀城內，竟然還有人敢搶梁大人的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不奇怪。如果能安安穩穩抵達尚蜀，梁大人又何苦特地找我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我一位老同學......你就當是尚蜀的魏彥吾就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊......魏先生啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽這口氣，各位與龍門魏公是熟識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平頭百姓也就罷了，可想在龍門混口飯吃的人，有幾個不熟知魏公？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認識魏公，和魏公認識，是兩碼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確是如此，不過我和魏彥吾的那點孽緣，就先不提了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。可惜，我是結識不了魏公那般人物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......了不起是了不起，但也沒有那麼了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，那位梁大人豈不是個大人物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能算大人物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算，怎麼不算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，你這話的意思是龍門魏公不算，還是梁大人不算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就算吧，如今都是個大人物了，嘖嘖嘖。當年還只是個不懂變通的愣頭青呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鯉先生倒還是老樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我在龍門討日子，和他一個尚蜀大官有多大關係？很久沒聯繫啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快瞧，是那小夥子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小烏有！你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲喲喲，別動，別動，渾身疼，渾身疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人哪，你是有所不知啊，剛才那丫頭耍起瘋勁來那叫一個狠，我使了渾身解數才勉強招架，趁著掌櫃拉架的空檔，趕緊開溜啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看你跑過來的模樣，分明就沒受傷嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扇子都收在手裡，哪使出渾身解數了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......瞞不過恩人......不過太久沒大張旗鼓地動過手了，確實有些抽筋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這位小兄弟是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然還沒正式入職，不過我那一顆鞠躬盡瘁的心，已經在羅德島跳動久矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是新入職的幹員朋友，幸會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好您好，聽恩人說，您也是羅德島的合作方？哎，不愧是羅德島，廣結善緣，深得人心，能結交到您這樣的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我老鯉就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉兄客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，兄弟你剛才說，那位掌櫃拉架，你才有機會跑出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是，怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......看來事情也沒那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別站在這聊天了，人多眼雜，要是再出什麼岔子，我可擔待不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們直接去梁府吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人只交代了讓我接你，帶這麼多人過去是不是有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想來梁大人也不是那麼小家子氣的人，各位剛才也幫了咱們一把，就一起去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁府啊......其實我們也不該去打攪別人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，有我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉兄這話爽快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......既然決定了，那就快點走，這邊，來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉兄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......我馬上就來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼......尚蜀難道流行這樣古怪的寵物嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鯉兄！快跟上！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......來了，這就來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的物件","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
